== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Greydwarfs|Aggressive creature strategies#Greydwarf}}
=== Attack ===
Swings their hand sideways in a 1.7-meter 90-degree horizontal arc to scratch the player (14 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage). This attack can be used every 2 seconds when within 1.2 meters of a player.

=== Throw ===
Winds their arm back before swinging forward to throw a rock (10 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] damage). The rock travels at 12 meters per second for up to 4 seconds before despawning and has a spread of 5 degrees. This attack can be used every 8 seconds when within 5–15 meters of a player.

